#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:9
msgid "原台账、退出条件与派生视图"
msgstr "Original ledgers, exit conditions and derived views"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:11
msgid ""
"下面的页面来自十一份原 CSV，不建立第二套状态数据库。每个任务保留原编号、顺序、 所有字段、退出条件、实现状态、软件／物理状态和原证据定位；源 "
"SHA-256 可核对。 原 CSV 没有单独退出字段时明确说明，不能从其他台账拼造一条“已通过”的条件。"
msgstr ""
"The following pages derive from eleven original CSV files; they do not "
"establish a second status database. Each task preserves its original "
"identifier, order, all fields, exit conditions, implementation status, "
"software/physical status and original evidence locators; the source SHA-256 "
"is available for comparison. If an original CSV has no separate exit field, "
"this is explicit; no passed condition may be assembled from another ledger."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:31
msgid ""
"`soc-ip-layout` 的 R01–R48 保留目录和共享 IP 重构的原状态。R43–R48 记录 精确 P "
"的软件执行、分段计划、SDK、资源与候选；其 `not_executed` 物理值不因 页面生成改变。最新结果导航见 "
"[软件证据入口](software-verification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"R01–R48 in `soc-ip-layout` preserve original directory and shared-IP "
"refactor states. R43–R48 record software execution, segmented plan coverage,"
" SDK, resources and the candidate for exact P; generating this page does not"
" change physical `not_executed` values. Find the latest results through the "
"[software evidence entry](software-verification.md)."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:35
msgid "正确解读状态"
msgstr "Interpret statuses correctly"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:37
msgid "`implemented` 表示实现存在；不保证当前 checkout 的完整软件资格。"
msgstr ""
"`implemented` means implementation exists; it does not guarantee complete "
"software qualification for the current checkout."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:38
msgid "`development_passed` 保留开发验证含义；不扩大成 clean-source 正式封存。"
msgstr ""
"`development_passed` retains its development-validation meaning; do not "
"expand it into formal clean-source archiving."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:39
msgid ""
"`qualification_record_authority` 要回到 [精确结果索引](software-verification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Consult the [exact results index](software-verification.md) for "
"`qualification_record_authority`."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:40
msgid "`implemented_tooling` 只表示工装实现，物理未执行仍为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"`implemented_tooling` only means tooling is implemented; unexecuted physical"
" work remains `not_executed`."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:41
msgid "`not_implemented`、`not_executed`、失败和有条件扩展保持原值。"
msgstr ""
"`not_implemented`, `not_executed`, failures and conditional extensions "
"retain their original values."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:42
msgid "不同专项重复覆盖同一机制，不能相加数量或计算全项目完成百分比。"
msgstr ""
"Different workstreams cover overlapping mechanisms; do not add their counts "
"or calculate project-wide completion percentages."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:44
msgid ""
"`platform-delivery-completion` 是开发体验迭代之后的同一后续任务权威，保留 N01–N14，并追加 A01–J04 与 "
"X01–X05 的完整工作分解。它不改写原 75 项的 退出条件或 P/E 软件执行身份；逐项完整退出条件继续保留，单个外设迁移不能关闭 "
"整个家族任务。N11 与 H 组物理任务需要真实设备；N13 与 J 组软件封存需要当前 clean source "
"的完整计划和离线复现，不能由旧候选或开发测试代替。"
msgstr ""
"`platform-delivery-completion` remains the same follow-up task authority "
"after the developer-experience iteration. It preserves N01–N14 and adds the "
"complete A01–J04 and X01–X05 work breakdown. It does not rewrite the "
"original 75-task exit conditions or P/E software identities. Each full exit "
"remains intact; migrating one peripheral cannot close a whole-family task. "
"N11 and the H-group physical tasks require real equipment. N13 and the "
"J-group software sealing require the current clean source, complete plan and"
" offline reproduction; old candidates or development tests do not replace "
"them."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:50
msgid ""
"本轮 C 冷态与工程交付观察继续写入 {download}`同一结果索引 <../delivery/platform-delivery-"
"completion-results.json>`的 `current_iteration_20261028`。`implemented` "
"家族行表示维护路径的 C 责任已经落地， 其开发模型、ARM 和最终合并源码的资格仍分开记录。首个干净增量的 SDK／双语文档 "
"和后续提交的普通门禁不自动覆盖新增工作树；H 组实际物理执行仍为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"This iteration's C cold-lifecycle and engineering delivery observations "
"continue in `current_iteration_20261028` within the {download}`same results "
"index <../delivery/platform-delivery-completion-results.json>`. An "
"`implemented` family row records C responsibility for its maintained paths; "
"development models, ARM checks and final integrated-source qualification "
"remain separate. The first clean increment's SDK/bilingual documentation and"
" a later commit's ordinary gate do not automatically cover new worktrees; "
"actual physical execution for group H remains `not_executed`."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:56
msgid ""
"`platform-refinement` 保留较早的 60 项完善记录；`io-evolution` 是当前 42 项增量 台账。两份台账复用 "
"`IO-` 编号，但来源、任务和退出条件不同，必须同时注明 CSV 或派生页面，不能按编号合并状态。增量台账的 `not_qualified` "
"保持原值；生成视图 不执行测试，也不提升软件或物理资格。"
msgstr ""
"`platform-refinement` retains the earlier 60-item refinement record; `io-"
"evolution` is the current 42-item increment ledger. Both reuse `IO-` IDs, "
"but their sources, tasks and exit conditions differ. Always name the CSV or "
"derived page; do not merge statuses by ID. The increment ledger retains its "
"original `not_qualified` values. Generating a view does not execute tests or"
" promote software or physical qualification."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:61
msgid ""
"旧“48 项 OS 清单”已继续扩展。现有原 CSV 的编号为 OS01–OS55；其中 OS49–OS55 "
"是物理工装／真实验收项，原状态均保留。构建系统的 48 项是另一个独立台账。 历史 RF 台账留在 "
"`docs/archive/implementation/`，通过 [历史入口](../reference/history.md) "
"访问，不能给当前支持建立资格。"
msgstr ""
"The old 48-item OS checklist has been expanded. Current CSV IDs are "
"OS01–OS55; OS49–OS55 cover physical tooling/actual acceptance, with all "
"original statuses retained. The 48 build-system tasks form a separate "
"ledger. Historical RF ledgers remain under `docs/archive/implementation/`, "
"reachable through the [history entry](../reference/history.md), and cannot "
"establish current support qualification."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:66
msgid "维护派生页"
msgstr "Maintain derived pages"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/status/ledgers.md:73
msgid ""
"第一条仅由同一原 CSV 重新生成视图；第二条检查 missing／stale，失败时返回非零， 不写文件。更改原台账后应重新生成，commit／CI "
"检查同一派生关系。生成、检查成功 只证明文档与原字段一致，不运行固件或采集硬件。实际测试证据见原结果索引。"
msgstr ""
"The first command only regenerates views from the same original CSV. The "
"second checks missing/stale output, returns nonzero on failure and writes "
"nothing. Regenerate after changing original ledgers; commit/CI checks the "
"same derivation relationship. Successful generation/checking only proves "
"documentation matches original fields; it executes no firmware and acquires "
"no hardware observations. Actual test evidence is in the original results "
"indexes."
